{"canManage() incorrectly grants manage access to users with only VIEW permission because it passes both VIEW and MANAGE scopes to hasPermission(), making it identical to canView(). Should only check MANAGE scope.": 0.9491637945175171, "getGroupIdsWithViewPermission adds authorization resource UUID (groupResource.getId()) instead of group model ID. Since hasPermission() looks up resources by name (where name = group model ID), the returned set contains wrong IDs causing the filter to never match, so users with group-level view-members permission would see no users. Should use groupResource.getName() instead.": 0.8051733374595642}